  <item>
    <title>Vol.26 年终总结：你的2024年关键词是什么？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6795b83ad74435e4a3d079f4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6795b83ad74435e4a3d079f4</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 26 Jan 2025 04:31:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>立下豪言壮志的月更播客，就这样被拖成了半年更！</span></p><span></span><p><span>在不更新的日子里大家的生活都发生了巨变：</span></p><span></span><p><span>喵喵回国在深圳做上了活力满满的品牌咨询顾问</span></p><span></span><p><span>杰德放弃了成为博士的科研大佬之路，回归了工作</span></p><span></span><p><span>莉莉在水深火热的广告公司做着都市隶人</span></p><span></span><p><span>这份年终关键词虽迟但到！</span></p><span></span><p><span>来盘一盘大家过去都发生了什么有趣的事情！</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hahaha~</span></p><span></span><p><span>2024立下的flag不知道倒了多少</span></p><span></span><p><span>但人生总归没有白犯的错，也没有白立的flag</span></p><span></span><p><span>只要充满勇气的拥抱未知</span></p><span></span><p><span>每一次迷路都是一个新的开始！</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：喵喵、杰德、莉莉</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：I'm Feeling Good</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="71">1:11</a>大家的新年关键词</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="408">6:48</a> 20%的人工作受到了影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="472">7:52</a> 发现读博不是理想坦途</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="812">13:32</a> 读博的起点是…追星？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="976">16:16</a> 工作才不是实现人生理想的钥匙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1016">16:56</a> 认真的活在当下就是Perfect Days</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1193">19:53</a> 原来这就是控制时间的魔法！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1283">21:23</a> 人生要有舍才有得</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1616">26:56</a> 要学会给自己关门</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1856">30:56</a> Get到了新的技能点：泰拳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2031">33:51</a> 不要害怕冲突</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2351">39:11</a> 卷也可以是一种活力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2540">42:20</a> 反对的不是卷而是成为螺丝钉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2670">44:30</a> 跨国创业的BUG</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2837">47:17</a> 原来命运自有安排！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a> 知道自己为什么卷就是破题之法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">55:00</a> 许下2025的新年愿望吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望大家的2025年都能越来越好~</span></p><span></span><p><span>也欢迎大家来评论区一起分享你的2024关键词！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/61dd7ac9848543661c6ab715/lojd2U5YBUbjY5P6U3n5P_kAzt_0.m4a" length="55369997" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:57:00</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo2ypVN2TTpvuM2Tfr-fHxv7Wr1m.png"/>
