  <item>
    <title>Vol.25 北京车展观察：对谈从消费电子跨界电车的王同学</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66437b1282b428eafd945af8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66437b1282b428eafd945af8</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 15 May 2024 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>刚刚结束不久的北京车展留下了无数话题。我们的老朋友王同学前脚刚参加完车展，后脚就在五一假期到访新加坡送上了新鲜热辣的业内人士第一手视角，顺便点评了一下汽车行业职业病病患在新加坡短短几天的观察，最后作为一个半道儿从电子消费品辞职转行做智能电车的过来人，跟大家分享一点折腾人生的心得。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：喵喵</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：王同学</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期大纲：</span></p><span></span><p><span>●北京车展电动车领域国产品牌大放异彩</span></p><span></span><p><span>●老牌燃油车老大哥品牌做车VS互联网新思维造车</span></p><span></span><p><span>●行业新技术的展示VS花式营销大杂烩</span></p><span></span><p><span>●中新两地购车思路</span></p><span></span><p><span>●跨行业瞎折腾有助于提升职业生涯体验感</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头曲：《乘客》- 王菲</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>节目中提到的酷炫车型一览~</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>红旗金葵花</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.faw.com.cn/fawcn/373694/tpxw76/5747489/index.html" data-url="https://www.faw.com.cn/fawcn/373694/tpxw76/5747489/index.html"><span>www.faw.com.cn</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>问界m9</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://aito.auto/model/m9/" data-url="https://aito.auto/model/m9/"><span>aito.auto</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>理想MEGA</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.lixiang.com/mega#li" data-url="https://www.lixiang.com/mega#li"><span>www.lixiang.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>小鹏G6</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaopeng.com/g6.html" data-url="https://www.xiaopeng.com/g6.html"><span>www.xiaopeng.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>蔚来换电站</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.nio.cn/nio-power" data-url="https://www.nio.cn/nio-power"><span>www.nio.cn</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>大众桑塔纳</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/" data-url="https://baike.baidu.com/item/"><span>baike.baidu.com</span></a><span>大众桑塔纳/8081546</span></p><span></span><p><span>奇瑞QQ</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/" data-url="https://baike.baidu.com/item/"><span>baike.baidu.com</span></a><span>奇瑞QQ/1289505</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkKSIDmTBcRUpHcNdIFvX8yg_y7w.m4a" length="75423721" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:17:32</itunes:duration>
