  <item>
    <title>Vol.20 离职访谈录 | 在巴厘岛学会当下的力量</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64d480e080c9ec4c5fdf5b5f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64d480e080c9ec4c5fdf5b5f</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 10 Aug 2023 10:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们再次邀请到人气嘉宾BoBo，然后和痛失网名的创业者喵喵聊聊她在巴厘岛的生活。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：杰德 喵喵&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：BoBo</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间戳：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="505">08:25</a> 旅居巴厘岛一个月，快乐似神仙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1090">18:10</a> 在doing和being之间找到自己的存在方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1379">22:59</a> 创业是一个分水岭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1529">25:29</a> 创业与打工最大的区别：使命感的实现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1644">27:24</a> 如何知道自己适合不适合创业？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2127">35:27</a> 倾听内心让我找到强大的内核</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2486">41:26</a> 放飞自我之后对于消费的态度变得更加理性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2624">43:44</a> 抛开对外在的声音的关注，更能重新认识自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2684">44:44</a> 每个人都有自己的天赋，我们的责任就是去发现原本属于自己的宝藏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2928">48:48</a> 如何发现自己的爱好和热情？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2963">49:23</a> 人生贵在体验，知识固然重要，但自己和这个世界的碰撞才是成长的最佳方法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3017">50:17</a> 如何找到做自己的勇气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3135">52:15</a> 最近在看的书和电影推荐时间~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3598">59:58</a> 在大爱中实现自我，成就他人</span></p><span></span><p><span>相关链接🔗</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. &nbsp;喵喵提到的电影 The Yin &amp; Yang of Gerry Lopez://www.patagonia.com/stories/the-yin-yang-of-gerry-lopez/video-121485.html</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. 杰德提到的书 Man's Search for Meaning</span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/1902303/" href="https://book.douban.com/subject/1902303/">book.douban.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>喵喵的公司</span></p><span></span><p><span>“寻找空间”是致力于赋能个人和团队转型的平台。我们在亚太地区首创了多个将正念（mindfulness）练习与潜能探索活动跨界融合的项目，诸如即兴戏剧这样的创意艺术表演和冲浪等户外活动。跨领域的灵感碰撞带来了全新的个人成长和团队转型模式，帮助参与者打破舒适区，孕育自发性和创造性，并鼓励参与者审视行为模式，找到“空间”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：寻找空间 The Space</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙：寻找空间</span></p><span></span><p><span>网站：findingthespace.com</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ll93qj1pITMUSpNq8SdlN4JJBm5m.m4a" length="65094228" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:06:30</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtXXs2NhSznv83G5Kn0YCuyBjY0a.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.19 在泉州搞不正经艺术：画一百扇古城家门的人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64cc90dbe490c5dee5891b69</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64cc90dbe490c5dee5891b69</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 04 Aug 2023 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期做客我们下周辞职的小伙伴：林小斌</span></p><span></span><p><span>一句话概括就是：不会画画的老师不是好的新媒体人</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家一起聊了聊神奇的自媒体探索之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span>以及与泉州这座城市一起发生的新旧故事</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：杰德、莉莉</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间戳：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="94">01:34</a> 当初谁还不是一个小职员</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">05:15</a> 考古不正经艺术真的有在聊艺术</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="470">07:50</a> 自己的东西就应该随心而为</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="656">10:56</a> 画画对我来说就是一个爱好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="697">11:37</a> 油画棒是便利好上手的材料</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="866">14:26</a> 本地人不逛景点却有意外发现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1127">18:47</a> 因为巷子里的门开启一段新故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1325">22:05</a> 对李先生来说它真的像皇宫一样漂亮</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1544">25:44</a> 张先生与显微镜下的泉州</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1960">32:40</a> 从一个石墩到一座牌坊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2343">39:03</a> 数据其实不重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2540">42:20</a> 主打一个随机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2658">44:18</a> 让人觉得是又臭又长的纪录片也没关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2767">46:07</a> city walk ？怕你们顶不住</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3055">50:55</a> 又到了我们的问题时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3220">53:40</a> 广告时间</span></p><span></span><p><span>图片分享</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltQVE28Z7byyx4miTTBux4ZK5d_v.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>油画棒作品《家门》</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrtXSbWv_lvImF1U53yvVKkC_eBf.png"></p><span></span><p><span>丁文塔的故居</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/luMBDt-SI9RGmKrwYPYkNrekKZYC.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>蚵壳厝</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ll_4LvY9-7IVlUmYwx_meLGgV8YB.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>泉州唯一仅存的壁灯</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lsDSip-QKREk7MnX_j1sr4Gmko_a.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>已经消失牌坊的绘画手稿</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lk3a0pOgAmwDrYMqE5YhdaGkMwXy.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>张和平先生</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqsa6rCVoz_j0vzNUYBdGFYCuoJS.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>家人们关注起来！全网自媒体账号：</span><a href="长按复制此条消息，打开抖音搜索，查看TA的更多作品。 https://v.douyin.com/iJLu3gVo/" data-url="长按复制此条消息，打开抖音搜索，查看TA的更多作品。 https://v.douyin.com/iJLu3gVo/"><span>不正经艺术</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lh-jBV69lvANYpr9ttq6wsqOxs3R.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家在评论区给我们留言，分享你的所想所感～</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们的邮箱：HiXZCZ@163.com（欢迎把我们当树洞）</span></p>]]></description>
