    <title>Vol.18 离职访谈录｜从电视台幕后到素人KOL</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64be880099e1e7669ee71cb4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64be880099e1e7669ee71cb4</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 24 Jul 2023 14:17:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>各位好久不见，我们失踪人口回归啦</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一次我们绑架了一个新朋友BoBo</span></p><span></span><p><span>聊了聊从电视台导播到Ai项目经理再到体育自媒体的斜杠之路</span></p><span></span><p><span>顺便逼叨逼叨最近生活上的小思考</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：杰德 喵喵 莉莉</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：BoBo</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间戳：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="166">02:46</a> 那个“旧媒体”是如何让你心灰意冷说再见的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="405">06:45</a> &nbsp;BoBo的媒体之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="641">10:41</a> AI对传统媒体的冲击和改变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="877">14:37</a> 如何狠心辞职？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1159">19:19</a> 辞职之后的新生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1462">24:22</a> 自媒体之路的开端（此处有狗粮）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1670">27:50</a> 一波五六七八折，感谢世界杯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1967">32:47</a> 如果重新选择职业会不一样嘛？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2134">35:34</a> 辞职后的一年都有什么改变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2339">38:59</a> 想象一下五年后的自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2671">44:31</a> 不怎么看书，但我看报纸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2746">45:46</a> 喜欢看旅行以及历史相关的书（此处有狗粮）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2885">48:05</a> 又到了广告牌时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3059">50:59</a> 不同城市有着不同的频率</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3604">1:00:04</a> 在社交上也需要寻找空间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4192">1:09:52</a> 好奇心是打开人和人之间屏障的钥匙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4410">1:13:30</a> 审视自己并非责怪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4410">1:13:30</a> 抽离与沉浸</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BoBo的自媒体账号：</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq2spqVrgb9PCmJ6H27YfwrK0tMR.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>巴厘岛美图分享，来自@喵喵</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpArAaGzjsKqGQYg95aauEY0iOIu.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqFFrWNL0BhbawxY1J1-0BKyLVse.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家在评论区给我们留言，分享你的所想所感～</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们的邮箱：HiXZCZ@163.com（欢迎把我们当树洞）</span></p>]]></description>
