  <item>
    <title>Vol.17 离职访谈录｜数字游民和她的100种生活</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/646a15cb6752b5f9deb66ca3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">646a15cb6752b5f9deb66ca3</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 22 May 2023 10:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Vol.17 离职访谈录｜数字游民和她的100种生活</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：Donna</span></p><span></span><p><span>过着一个月一个地方旅居生活的数字游民，《遇见一百种生活》专栏作者，正在学习和成长的一位life coach。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：杰德，肥肥安</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间戳：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="77">1:17</a> 什么是数字游民？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">2:10</a> 什么工作比较适合数字游民？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="226">3:46</a> Donna的第一桶金</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="693">11:33</a> 旅居生活如何保持生产力？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1155">19:15</a> 如何结识志同道合的朋友？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1234">20:34</a> “灵魂可以安然栖息的地方”——serendipity空间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1315">21:55</a> &nbsp;用短信写小说？Donna的有趣经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 写作给你带来什么样的快乐？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1548">25:48</a> “开始写作吧”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1670">27:50</a> 言语中的省略部分，往往是正解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1830">30:30</a> 当代最重要的两种技能</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1937">32:17</a> 开始学习life coach</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a> 推荐给朋友最多的一本书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2493">41:33</a> 最喜欢的数字游民工具/平台</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a> 学习和成长方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2768">46:08</a> 为什么选择做数字游民</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>相关链接</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>1.《遇见一百种生活》专栏：<a data-url="https://xiaobot.net/p/100lives?refer=1364cbbf-c8f9-401c-a7b6-fa0d69018188" href="https://xiaobot.net/p/100lives?refer=1364cbbf-c8f9-401c-a7b6-fa0d69018188">xiaobot.net</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>2. Serendipity空间（上期节目的主角，欢迎收听）<a data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6443a8a29361a4e7c333df26" href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6443a8a29361a4e7c333df26">www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家在评论区给我们留言，分享你的所想所感～</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们的邮箱：HiXZCZ@163.com（欢迎把我们当树洞）</span></p>]]></description>
