  <item>
    <title>Vol.16 数字游民生活初体验</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6443a8a29361a4e7c333df26</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6443a8a29361a4e7c333df26</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 22 Apr 2023 09:28:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h1><br></h1><span></span><h1><span>下周辞职小伙伴节后首聚</span><br><span>（肥肥惨遭资本家的毒手加班ing~ 抱住！）</span></h1><span></span><p><span>喵喵从四季如夏的小新回国啦！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>面基指日可待，此处欢呼声响起~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期作为新晋企业家AKA数字游民的喵喵，分享在小岛海南的数字游民社区的见闻~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：喵喵 莉莉 杰德</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间戳:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="154">02:34</a> 精灵一样的茄子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="296">04:56</a> 数字游民社区是个啥？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="441">07:21</a> 作为新村民的转变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="736">12:16</a> 获取快乐源泉的方式？比如爬树！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="983">16:23</a> 不小心创造餐厅地狱特调——柠檬咖啡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1265">21:05</a> 咱们就是要打开思路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1582">26:22</a> 实不相瞒，我每天都在演戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1760">29:20</a> 碳水加碳水，快乐加倍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2061">34:21</a> 感受当下是一种刚需</span></p><span></span><p><span>「大量美图来袭 」</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjrKotU5KixvS7DJgPPY43OvNlXY.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>（茄子本人）</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5fb9be2f0000000001008cf4?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=56cb272584edcd4047ee9a8e&amp;apptime=1682155413" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5fb9be2f0000000001008cf4?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=56cb272584edcd4047ee9a8e&amp;apptime=1682155413"><span>Serendipity空间</span></a><br><span>位于海南文昌的自然乡村</span></p><span></span><p><span>Serendipity：“fortunate happenstance" or "pleasant surprose".&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>正如其名，serendipity空间是一个意外发现与收获的舞台，是一场自然流动的共创社区。我们在大自然中感受、劳作、舞动与创造。</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9kb2NpbWc0LmRvY3MucXEuY29tL2ltYWdlL0FnQUFCdENaeldPcC02Nl92aVpDMUpkTHIwUnp4NHljLmpwZWc_dz0xMjgwJmg9MTcwNw==.jpeg"></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9kb2NpbWczLmRvY3MucXEuY29tL2ltYWdlL0FnQUFCdENaeldNWnpueDRSSmxPNjdEN3c0cFd2WW9PLmpwZWc_dz0xNzA3Jmg9MTI4MA==.jpeg"></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9kb2NpbWcxMC5kb2NzLnFxLmNvbS9pbWFnZS9BZ0FBQnRDWnpXUEtUeWVnZS1wRDA2RVNDZ2ZraDRwSy5qcGVnP3c9MTcwNyZoPTEyODA=.jpeg"></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9kb2NpbWcxMC5kb2NzLnFxLmNvbS9pbWFnZS9BZ0FBQnRDWnpXTUVHblhsbVFKTUg3V0M5emlLZDBRNS5qcGVnP3c9MTI4MCZoPTE3MDc=.jpeg"></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9kb2NpbWc2LmRvY3MucXEuY29tL2ltYWdlL0FnQUFCdENaeldOWlBBRUdJb05NbG9vVDZwcldtR01LLmpwZWc_dz0xMjgwJmg9MTcwNw==.jpeg"></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9kb2NpbWc2LmRvY3MucXEuY29tL2ltYWdlL0FnQUFCdENaeldPOGc2UTZyTk5BWTVYWWp5Z29lRWdtLmpwZWc_dz0xMjgwJmg9MTcwNw==.jpeg"></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9kb2NpbWc3LmRvY3MucXEuY29tL2ltYWdlL0FnQUFCdENaeldPaTRLU19nRGxKQXJGcTdGTGJ0VWp2LmpwZWc_dz0xMjgwJmg9MTcwNw==.jpeg"></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家在评论区给我们留言，分享你的所想所感～</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们的邮箱：HiXZCZ@163.com（欢迎把我们当树洞）</span></p>]]></description>
