  <item>
    <title>Vol.15 和职场咨询师聊聊人生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64254bee8aca9099d7b5cfd9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64254bee8aca9099d7b5cfd9</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 31 Mar 2023 10:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>失踪人口回归，本期下周辞职由：</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们的金牌Moderator AKA 知名创业家 喵喵 独挑大梁。在热带的小新，和集美丽与智慧于一身的资深职场教练—— Carrie</span></p><span></span><p><span>唠唠一唠唠，职场升级打怪的过程中，也许也可以不走寻常路。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhEQDJievi8s-PKVONQO6FPztWUk.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期特邀嘉宾：Carrie Zang</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：喵喵 （独挑大梁）</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头片尾曲：Cat Power - The Greatest</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间戳:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="129">02:09</a> 捕获一枚野生Carrie</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="322">05:22</a> 从记者转型到人力资源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="401">06:41</a> 无论你是谁都能可以通过自己的方式获得成功</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="763">12:43</a> 打工人 vs 创业者 vs 自由职业者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="905">15:05</a> 创业者是自由更多的一个选项吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1262">21:02</a> 当确定性全抹去之后，真的就自由了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 寻找真实的自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1831">30:31</a> work &amp; life 到底需不需要balance ？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2104">35:04</a> 职业规划Top1: 老师我能赚多少钱？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2571">42:51</a> 下周辞职 ，可说呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2804">46:44</a> Career Coach 存在的意义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2913">48:33</a> 老板为什么这么傻？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3099">51:39</a> Carrie 老师自己是如何探索自己的路的呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3322">55:22</a> 去读MBA，还是谈恋爱？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3847">1:04:07</a> 非典型职业路径</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4011">1:06:51</a> 是谁给你的勇气？不是梁静茹，是没想过！</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家在评论区给我们留言，分享你的所想所感～</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们的邮箱：HiXZCZ@163.com（欢迎把我们当树洞）</span></p>]]></description>
